title: SwiftDet
abstract: "SwiftDet — a custom lightweight object-detection architecture (SwiftDet-PConv-CPU) for efficient CPU inference, trained on Pascal VOC 2007 + 2012. Includes training, evaluation and ONNX/INT8 deployment code and live-camera inference tools."
